      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-696-726">唯今肥後邸ニ横井を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-726-750"><rb>尋</rb><rt>（たづね）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-750-783">候所、夜前申合候通、伏</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-786-831"><seg source="#source-783-786">水</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-807-816">（見）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-831-834">ニ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-834-864"><rb>相待</rb><rt>（あひまつ）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-864-923">と申て、今日八ツ時頃、出足ニて候よし。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-926-953"><rb>下拙</rb><rt>（げせつ）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-953-989">ニ於ても一言、神戸へまて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989-1025"><rb>申遣</rb><rt>（まうしつかは）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1025-1028">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1028-1055"><rb>度儀</rb><rt>（たきぎ）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1055-1058">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1058-1103"><rb><seg source="#source-1061-1064">有</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1064-1076">レ</note><seg source="#source-1076-1079">之</seg></rb><rt>（これあり）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1103-1163">、又先刻御談申せし儀も有て、薩邸ニも早々</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1163-1196"><rb>参多</rb><rt>（まゐりた）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1196-1204">し。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-1204-1318">故ニ今夜伏水ニ下り明朝上京と存付候間、吉井への状一封今夜中、何卒御遣しの程</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1318-1375"><rb><seg source="#source-1321-1324">奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1324-1336">レ</note><seg source="#source-1336-1339">希</seg></rb><rt>（ねがひたてまつる）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1375-1380">。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1380-1409" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p><seg source="#source-1398-1409">頓首々</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1409-1438" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1430-1438">八日</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1438-1476" style="padding-inline-end: 2em; text-align: right">
        <p><seg source="#source-1468-1476">花押</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1476-1520" style="padding-inline-end: 3em; text-align: right">
        <p><seg source="#source-1506-1520">坂本龍馬</seg></p>
